  "payload": {
    "approximation_regime": "ASYMPTOTIC; The mean identities are asserted exact. The included asymptotic corollary has additive remainder e^(-beta)2^(n-nu)(4^nu-1)o(1), without an explicit constant; the record is marked ASYMPTOTIC to retain that corollary's weaker strength.",
    "assumptions": [
      {
        "condition_id": "condition:compressible-mean-0",
        "origin": "SOURCE_RECONSTRUCTED",
        "source_span_refs": [
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:6ef8636949472cd681bd5b1a62100257a6a8ca715bef5c9a62ddf2cb42d53db0",
